<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= _throws (fn : () -> ()) : option exn =\n    := none = None : option exn\n    := caught (ex : exn) : option (option exn) = Some (Some ex)\n    try\n        \\ () =>\n            fn ()\n            none\n        caught\n    |> optionm::value\n\n:= ^ print_and_return x =\n    := name = reflection::nameof { print_and_return }\n    name ++#? { x }\n    |> console::write_line\n    x\n\n:= counterexamples (limit : i32) (lo : i64) (hi : i64) (reference : i64 -> i64) (candidate : i64 -> i64) : list i64 =\n    :~ ^ go (x : i64) (left : i32) (found : list i64) : list i64 =\n        ? x > hi ?> found\n        |? left <= 0i32 ?> found\n        |? reference x = candidate x ?> go (x + 1i64) left found\n        |: go (x + 1i64) (left - 1i32) (x :: found)\n    go lo limit [] |> listm::rev","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := _throws (fn : () -> ()) : option exn =
      := none = None : option exn
      := caught (ex : exn) : option (option exn) = Some (Some ex)
      try
          \ () =>
              fn ()
              none
          caught
      |> optionm::value

  := ^ print_and_return x =
      := name = reflection::nameof { print_and_return }
      name ++#? { x }
      |> console::write_line
      x

  := counterexamples (limit : i32) (lo : i64) (hi : i64) (reference : i64 -> i64) (candidate : i64 -> i64) : list i64 =
      :~ ^ go (x : i64) (left : i32) (found : list i64) : list i64 =
          ? x > hi ?> found
          |? left <= 0i32 ?> found
          |? reference x = candidate x ?> go (x + 1i64) left found
          |: go (x + 1i64) (left - 1i32) (x :: found)
      go lo limit [] |> listm::rev
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### counterexamples_find_where_multiply_shift_stops_dividing_by_three (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> zig\n\n:= divide (x : i64) : i64 = x / 3i64\n:= multiply_shift (x : i64) : i64 = (x * 43691i64) >>> 17i32\ncounterexamples 3i32 0i64 65535i64 divide multiply_shift |> listm::length |> _assert_eq 0i32\ncounterexamples 2i32 0i64 200000i64 divide multiply_shift\n|> listm::fold (\\ packed x => packed * 1000000i64 + x) 0i64\n|> \\ packed => (packed = 131072131075i64) |> _assert_eq !+","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> zig

  := divide (x : i64) : i64 = x / 3i64
  := multiply_shift (x : i64) : i64 = (x * 43691i64) >>> 17i32
  counterexamples 3i32 0i64 65535i64 divide multiply_shift |> listm::length |> _assert_eq 0i32
  counterexamples 2i32 0i64 200000i64 divide multiply_shift
  |> listm::fold (\ packed x => packed * 1000000i64 + x) 0i64
  |> \ packed => (packed = 131072131075i64) |> _assert_eq !+
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

