#### expect_is_silent_when_its_condition_holds (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n\nexpect (1i32 + 1i32 = 2i32) \"arithmetic\"\nexpect (\"ab\" <> \"\") \"a non-empty string\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> rust

  expect (1i32 + 1i32 = 2i32) "arithmetic"
  expect ("ab" <> "") "a non-empty string"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
